{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19612","headline":"山鸡舞石镜 · 崔护","name":"山鸡舞石镜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庐峯开石镜，人说舞山鸡。\n物象纤舞隐，禽情秖自迷。\n景当烟雾歇，心喜锦翎齐。\n宛转乌呈彩，婆娑凤欲栖。\n何言资羽族，在地得天倪。\n应笑翰音者，终朝饮败醯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔护","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19612.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19612","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}